1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,945
Fat is handled almost entirely in the intestine.

2
00:00:03,945 --> 00:00:13,971
Bile from the liver has no enzyme at all: its salts emulsify the fat into tiny droplets, giving lipase far more surface to work on.

3
00:00:13,971 --> 00:00:17,421
The products: fatty acids and glycerol.

